{"id":424,"date":"2024-07-29T08:24:22","date_gmt":"2024-07-29T08:24:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?page_id=424"},"modified":"2024-09-23T10:18:14","modified_gmt":"2024-09-23T10:18:14","slug":"terms-conditions","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/terms-conditions\/","title":{"rendered":"Terms &#038; Conditions"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"424\" class=\"elementor elementor-424\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9ee7770 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9ee7770\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-143c397 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"143c397\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Terms &amp; Conditions<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ae9f93 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6ae9f93\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8226375 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8226375\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Welcome to <strong>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong>. By accessing or using our website, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following Terms and Conditions. Please review these terms carefully before using our services. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you may not access the website or use any of our services.<\/p><h3>1. Acceptance of Terms<\/h3><p>By accessing and using this website, you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions, as well as our Privacy Policy. These terms apply to all visitors, users, and others who access or use our site.<\/p><h3>2. Use of Our Website<\/h3><p>You agree to use our website and services only for lawful purposes. You are prohibited from using the site:<\/p><ul><li>In any way that violates applicable local, national, or international laws.<\/li><li>For fraudulent purposes or in connection with a criminal offense.<\/li><li>To transmit, or procure the sending of, any unsolicited or unauthorized advertising or promotional material.<\/li><li>To attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of our website, the server on which our site is stored, or any server, computer, or database connected to our site.<\/li><\/ul><h3>3. Intellectual Property<\/h3><p>All content, trademarks, logos, images, text, graphics, software, and other materials available on the Shop Cardboard Boxes website are the property of <strong>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong> or licensed to us. You may not reproduce, distribute, or use any content from this website without prior written permission from us.<\/p><p>You are granted a limited license to access and make personal use of this site. This license does not include any resale or commercial use of this site or its contents without our express written consent.<\/p><h3>4. Product Information<\/h3><p>We strive to provide accurate descriptions and details of our products, including dimensions, colors, and specifications. However, we do not guarantee that all descriptions are completely accurate, current, or error-free. Images displayed on our website are for illustrative purposes only, and actual product appearance may vary slightly.<\/p><h3>5. Pricing &amp; Payment<\/h3><p>All prices listed on our website are in [Currency] and are subject to change without notice. We reserve the right to modify prices or discontinue products at any time. We accept various payment methods, and all payments must be made in full at the time of purchase.<\/p><p>In the event of an incorrect price listing, we reserve the right to cancel any orders placed for products listed at the incorrect price, whether or not the order has been confirmed and your payment processed. If your payment has already been processed, we will issue a refund for the total amount.<\/p><h3>6. Shipping &amp; Delivery<\/h3><p>We aim to ship your order within the estimated timeframe provided at checkout. However, delivery times are subject to change due to factors beyond our control, such as shipping carrier delays or unforeseen circumstances. We are not responsible for any delays in delivery caused by these factors.<\/p><p>Shipping costs are calculated based on your location and the weight of the products ordered. Additional charges for expedited shipping or international shipping may apply.<\/p><h3>7. Returns &amp; Refunds<\/h3><p>We want you to be completely satisfied with your purchase. If you are not satisfied, please contact us within [number] days of receiving your order to initiate a return or exchange. Products must be in their original, unused condition and include all packaging materials.<\/p><p>We do not accept returns on custom or personalized products unless there is a defect in workmanship or damage during transit.<\/p><p>Refunds will be issued once we receive the returned products and confirm their condition. The refund amount will exclude any shipping fees, and you may be responsible for return shipping costs unless the return is due to an error on our part.<\/p><h3>8. Limitation of Liability<\/h3><p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, <strong>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong> shall not be liable for any damages that result from the use of, or the inability to use, the materials on this site, even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages. This includes, but is not limited to, loss of data, profit, or business arising out of or in connection with the use of this website.<\/p><p>We do not guarantee that our website will be available at all times or that it will be free from errors, viruses, or other harmful components.<\/p><h3>9. Changes to Terms &amp; Conditions<\/h3><p>We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms &amp; Conditions at any time without prior notice. Your continued use of the website following the posting of any changes constitutes acceptance of those changes. We encourage you to review these terms periodically for any updates.<\/p><h3>\u00a0<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-178d55b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"178d55b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-64b5567 elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode\" data-id=\"64b5567\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"shortcode.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-shortcode\">\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"container\" data-elementor-id=\"2174\" class=\"elementor elementor-2174\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-652454b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"652454b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d7b314f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d7b314f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cc4a86f elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cc4a86f\" data-element_type=\"widget